# =========================
# Public Repo Discipline (added 2026-07-21, S1145 findasale-hacker/records pass)
# =========================
# This repo is PUBLIC (S-public, 2026-07-06) for free GitHub Actions minutes —
# private-tier minutes were exhausted within days on a prior attempt, per
# Patrick. claude_docs/ contains internal strategy, legal-risk analysis, and
# security audits that should never be public-repo content regardless of repo
# visibility. Untracked here going forward (existing tracked history requires
# a one-time `git rm -r --cached claude_docs/` — see pushblock). New sensitive
# docs (legal risk, security posture, unresolved ToS/compliance decisions) go
# to the private internal record, never here.
claude_docs/

# =========================
# Encoded Windows temp path artifacts (VM encoding issue)
# =========================
"packages/backend/C:"*
"packages/frontend/C:"*
packages/backend/C:
packages/frontend/C:

# Analytics OAuth credentials (never commit)
claude_docs/scripts/.analytics-creds.json

# Security audit output — maps secret locations; never commit to public repo
claude_docs/audits/secrets-audit-*.md

# centralized local secrets for scheduled tasks (never commit)
.secrets.env

# Local DB/infra backups — 619MB, must never enter git history
backups/

# =========================
# Raw footage (ADR-079) — large video binaries, must never enter git history
# (mirrors the backups/ entry above). Contents ignored, folder structure kept
# via .gitkeep so incoming/processed always exist for a fresh clone.
# =========================
raw-footage/*
!raw-footage/incoming/
!raw-footage/incoming/.gitkeep
!raw-footage/processed/
!raw-footage/processed/.gitkeep

# native footage->R2 uploader (contains rclone binary + R2 creds; never commit)
.footage-sync/

# Stray runtime-generated files in public/downloads (e.g. random-named temp
# zips from ad-hoc test/download activity) -- keep only the two committed
# downloadable deliverables. (S1140)
packages/frontend/public/downloads/*
!packages/frontend/public/downloads/findasale-marketplace-extension.zip
!packages/frontend/public/downloads/sale-starter-kit.pdf
